SUMMARY:Afternoon @ Zinchouse Winery
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nLet's venture over to Zinchouse for 
 some drinks\, socializing\, and live music! A classic hang with drinks and
  mingling at one of the cutest venues around. It’s Mother’s Day weeken
 d so bring your mom too! (I’m bringing mine)\n\nLive Music starts at 4pm
  and keeps goingg throughout the night + foodtrucks (until 8pm so be there
  early uf you’re coming hungry)\n\nHope to see you there!
