SUMMARY:Bull City: Walk & Brew 🍻 
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nWhen I first moved to Durham\, I dro
 ve everywhere downtown like a fool 💀 then I realized this city is actua
 lly mad walkable and all the spots I like are way closer together than the
 y feel in a car.\n\nSo I’m introducing the Bull City Walk & Brew 🍻\n\
 nA roughly 3-mile downtown loop with 3 stops\, good vibes\, a little movem
 ent\, and a chance to actually enjoy the city on foot. We’ll meet at Cen
 tral Park and stop at each spot for about 30 minutes before heading to the
  next.\n\nThis week’s route:\nDurham Central Park → Bull Mccabes → P
 onysaurus → Parts & Labor (next to motorco\, great food!)\n\nCome walk\,
  have a drink\, see downtown\, and pretend we’re the kind of people who 
 do wholesome social activities. (There’s free street parking downtown on
  the weekends too!)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31450
 1994/
